## Contribution guidelines for this section
- Every entry must include the metadata block below at the top.
- Cite all non-original claims using APA format; see `references/bibliography.md`.
- Clearly separate summary, analysis, and personal interpretation.
- Commit messages should describe *what* changed and *why* (e.g. `Add essay on epistemic humility`, not `update`).

